ivsExtract extracts data from Integrated Values Surveys data 
(from the European Values Study (EVS) and the World Values 
Survey (WVS)), in csv format.

ivsExtract is distributed under the terms of the Reciprocal Public
License RPL. See the file LICENSE.

This software is OSI Certified Open Source Software.
OSI Certified is a certification mark of the Open Source Initiative.

To install ivsExtract, see the file INSTALL.

Comments, suggestions, bug reports are welcome.

